{
  "Npcs.Kitsune.Desc": "A kitsune stands in front of you, about five and a half feet tall. She has a head of long, silky hair, large furry ears poking through it, and six luxurious tails swaying behind her. Her robes are revealing but comfortable-looking, hugging her curves and exposing large swaths of tattooed skin."
  "Npcs.Kitsune.Name": "Kitsune"
}
